        "template--14393127141451__634b2e44-0ac1-4fc6-84d3-0dc8cbb09bfb-column-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "As the owners of Footwear and Apparel NZ Ltd we welcome you to join us and look forward to being of service to you and your business.",
            "text": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--14393127141451__634b2e44-0ac1-4fc6-84d3-0dc8cbb09bfb-column-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-owners.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Footwear & Apparel NZ Ltd is NZ-owned & NZ-operated with over 25 years in the industry.  We help organisations across the country outfit their teams with quality footwear, workwear, uniforms and safety equipment curated for real NZ conditions and workers.</p><p>We work alongside businesses of all sizes — from small teams to large organisations — across industries including construction, civil, food and transport, corporate offices, councils and government agencies. Our focus is simple: to provide reliable products, practical advice, and solutions that work in the real world.</p><p>From certified safety footwear and PPE to branded uniforms and corporate clothing, we help our customers choose the right gear to keep their teams safe, comfortable and looking professional. We also offer custom in-house branding and logo application, so your workwear reflects your organisation with consistency and pride.</p><p>With over 25 years of industry experience, our team understands that no two businesses are the same. That’s why we take a personalised approach — listening to your needs, recommending the right products, and supporting you with ongoing service whether you shop online or in-store.</p><p>At Footwear & Apparel NZ, we’re proud to build long-term relationships with our customers and be a trusted partner for their workwear, uniform and safety needs.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
