          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p><strong>Footwear & Apparel NZ Ltd - </strong>established for over 25 years is now privately owned and operated by Stuart and Rebecca Williams. Stu has over 20 years of sales experience in retail and wholesale markets. He is a Health & Safety professional, with a wealth of experience and a following of loyal and satisfied customers. You’ll enjoy meeting him and come to trust his opinion, looking to him for footwear, clothing and safety solutions.</p><p>Our team is well grounded and have an excellent grasp on products and their use.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
